nemies, complete quests, find secrets and keep the world safe! \n\nWith a pull of the trigger you'll shoot a physics-based web that you can swing around on. Using a full physics body you'll be able to walk on any surface, flip around with acrobatics, climb around, hold onto other players and truly feel immersed in the world of Web-Guy! \n\nDefeat enemies at crimes around the city and keep the world safe! Through questlines you'll unlock powers and gadgets to help you with your crime-fighting!", "short_description": "Eat a spider and become Web-Guy in Untangled! Swing around the wacky worlds with your friends, defeat enemies, complete quests, find secrets and keep the world safe!"}]}, "developer_name": "Rigged Games", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://riggedvr.github.io/UntangledPrivacy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Rigged Games", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://riggedvr.github.io/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_FEW", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "SITTING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER"], "id": "34736816055964792"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819311_1454681855544591_5654376424763323885_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=1&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=cRisiHTy52kQ7kNvwGakXF9&_nc_oc=AdqCvY4A2lA9jocO8mCGK63IoJatV2rB5gg2qHPm-KkAPwDWZXmfBgPQn0DEU0pcehM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad